WEBVTT

00:14.387 --> 00:16.196
Oi, the hell're you doin'?!

00:16.200 --> 00:19.403
Where'd that bitch go?!

00:19.507 --> 00:20.892
You're not gettin' away!

00:31.704 --> 00:35.513
What's wrong, Sakura? You've
been fidgety for a while now.

00:35.704 --> 00:38.104
I'm not f-fidgety.

00:38.627 --> 00:41.741
I'm just miffed that we got
called out on a weekend.

00:42.043 --> 00:45.883
Oh, so you're excited to hang out with everyone?

00:45.944 --> 00:47.600
I-I am not!

00:47.735 --> 00:51.003
I get it. I feel the same way!

00:51.089 --> 00:52.400
I said I wasn't!

00:52.867 --> 00:58.830
Tsubaki also said he'd give us a
reward for cheering up Mr. Ito!

00:59.323 --> 01:02.707
I'm excited to see what kind
of restaurant he recommended!

01:03.040 --> 01:07.569
My info says he likes all kinds of sweets,
so it'll probably have tasty ones!

01:07.686 --> 01:09.433
Nire's in top form.

01:09.747 --> 01:10.880
Seriously…

01:12.732 --> 01:14.012
Seriously what, Sakura?

01:14.160 --> 01:18.338
I've been wondering for a while,
but what happened to your face?

01:19.015 --> 01:20.307
Did someone hurt you?

01:21.747 --> 01:25.218
O-Oh, this? I tripped, is all.

01:25.538 --> 01:26.640
Right, Suo?

01:28.110 --> 01:30.221
Huh? You tripped?

01:30.572 --> 01:32.140
And Suo was with you when…

01:32.140 --> 01:34.110
Hey, don't worry about that!

01:34.110 --> 01:35.975
- We have places to be!
- Fine, quit pushing!

01:37.513 --> 01:40.166
Is this the right way? We've been walking forever.

01:40.541 --> 01:43.046
Oh, we turn here, then it's straight ahead.

01:43.156 --> 01:43.723
Hm?

01:44.320 --> 01:46.320
Nire, are you sure that's right?

01:46.412 --> 01:48.461
Uh, yeah? It should be th…

01:49.756 --> 01:50.506
[Bar]

01:51.218 --> 01:52.383
This is, uh, the red-light district.

01:52.383 --> 01:53.464
[Keisei Street]
This is, uh, the red-light district.

01:53.464 --> 01:55.011
[Keisei Street]

03:30.375 --> 03:31.858
Hey, wanna have some fun?

03:32.172 --> 03:34.233
Nice and cheap! Any takers?

03:36.689 --> 03:39.396
What?! The map says it's through here!

03:39.741 --> 03:40.923
Good evening!

03:41.643 --> 03:44.473
Would you like to employ our services, Master?

03:44.787 --> 03:47.723
Wha?! M-M-M-M-Master?!

03:49.076 --> 03:50.520
Lookin' for a good bar?

03:50.520 --> 03:53.415
Ah, no, we're underage.

04:02.627 --> 04:04.400
Wait a sec, guys!

04:04.621 --> 04:05.550
What now?

04:05.729 --> 04:07.064
What's up, Nire?

04:07.458 --> 04:08.430
Let's…

04:08.929 --> 04:10.400
Let's turn back!

04:10.664 --> 04:13.366
I'll ask Tsubaki if we got the right address!

04:13.489 --> 04:15.716
Back through there?! Screw that!

04:16.049 --> 04:16.935
Let's move.

04:16.940 --> 04:18.246
Wait! I mean it!

04:18.393 --> 04:21.193
High-schoolers don't go to places like this!

04:21.483 --> 04:24.043
This isn't like Furin's turf at all!

04:24.295 --> 04:26.240
Yeah, it's not like our turf,

04:26.707 --> 04:29.636
but that's just because it's more lit up.

04:42.055 --> 04:44.172
A woman fell from the sky?!

04:44.233 --> 04:45.396
She sure did.

04:45.489 --> 04:47.532
A-Are you okay, Sakura?!

04:48.867 --> 04:50.344
Wh-What was that about?

04:51.003 --> 04:52.338
E-Excuse me!

04:52.916 --> 04:54.929
A-A-A-A-Are you okay?!

04:55.027 --> 04:57.593
I'm so sorry! I was just in such a rush!

04:57.938 --> 05:01.101
- You're not hurt, are you?!
- Stop! Quit pulling!

05:01.175 --> 05:02.658
You're making it hurt!

05:02.713 --> 05:04.467
They both look fine.

05:06.590 --> 05:10.283
You seem to be hurt, yourself.
And your dress is ripped.

05:10.436 --> 05:10.916
Huh?

05:11.169 --> 05:12.910
Oh, you're right. I'm bleeding!

05:12.966 --> 05:14.572
And my necklace is gone!

05:14.806 --> 05:16.369
But why?!

05:16.683 --> 05:18.418
What's got you in such a rush?

05:18.590 --> 05:20.283
You came flying at me.

05:21.126 --> 05:25.510
O-Oh, right. I'm in a hurry, so I'll be going now!

05:25.510 --> 05:26.473
H-Hey!

05:27.581 --> 05:30.621
Damn, you're really wastin' my time.

05:31.384 --> 05:34.572
And no matter how much I
spend, I get paid the same.

05:34.880 --> 05:35.963
You got that?

05:36.578 --> 05:39.261
I was told to bring in one woman,

05:40.480 --> 05:42.615
but I ain't gettin' paid enough.

05:43.009 --> 05:46.000
Uh, S-Suo, these guys…

05:46.240 --> 05:46.744
Mm.

05:47.415 --> 05:50.504
We don't even have to guess.
They were chasing her.

05:50.984 --> 05:53.003
Who're they? Your friends?

05:53.433 --> 05:55.316
N-No, they're…

05:55.320 --> 05:56.560
And if we are?

05:57.403 --> 05:59.680
Say we are her friends. Then what?

06:00.000 --> 06:00.701
Tch.

06:01.507 --> 06:03.944
This kid doesn't know his manners.

06:04.683 --> 06:08.381
Any other day, I'd lay you flat,
but I ain't got the time.

06:09.206 --> 06:10.855
Give us the girl.

06:11.729 --> 06:13.544
Or else.

06:15.593 --> 06:20.301
I-I'll go. I'll go, so please, don't fight.

06:26.141 --> 06:27.876
Or else what?

06:28.812 --> 06:32.793
You got this many guys chasing one beat-up woman.

06:33.446 --> 06:35.686
So, or else what?

06:36.332 --> 06:37.329
Spit it out.

06:40.738 --> 06:44.510
Every single person we meet costs us time.

06:44.990 --> 06:47.667
I ain't gettin' paid enough for this!

06:49.790 --> 06:52.683
Suo, you stick by Nire and the girl.

06:56.116 --> 06:58.455
U-Um…

06:59.046 --> 07:00.923
I-I'm okay.

07:01.606 --> 07:02.516
I can…

07:03.569 --> 07:04.916
take care of myself.

07:05.501 --> 07:07.513
I'll stick with her, too.

07:08.080 --> 07:09.938
You two just focus on these guys.

07:10.196 --> 07:11.280
What are you talki…

07:11.280 --> 07:11.975
Sakura.

07:12.369 --> 07:13.975
You heard Nire.

07:14.338 --> 07:16.030
Let's trust him, okay?

07:16.473 --> 07:17.680
I'll back him up.

07:18.443 --> 07:21.600
Like relying on people near you who can move.

07:21.821 --> 07:23.489
Believe in them.

07:25.520 --> 07:26.381
Got it.

07:27.132 --> 07:28.652
Take care of her, Nirei.

07:29.827 --> 07:31.101
You got it, Sakura!

07:31.409 --> 07:34.510
Quit your mumblin'! I said I ain't got time!

07:37.520 --> 07:39.569
Eat shit, punks!

07:46.406 --> 07:48.738
You damn kid!

08:00.246 --> 08:03.224
Dammit… You punk!

08:15.889 --> 08:17.969
Is he really gonna be okay?

08:23.249 --> 08:24.104
Crap!

08:24.381 --> 08:26.270
Let's trust him, okay?

08:29.932 --> 08:32.910
You're in the way, shithead!

08:34.664 --> 08:36.713
Don't close your eyes! Don't do it!

08:36.984 --> 08:37.876
Keep them open!

08:38.332 --> 08:40.566
Draw him in until the very last second…

08:40.904 --> 08:41.950
Nire, now!

08:48.966 --> 08:50.050
[Café Pothos]

08:50.050 --> 08:51.384
[Café Pothos]
See ya tomorrow.

08:52.738 --> 08:53.606
Nire.

08:54.929 --> 08:56.701
Mind walking back together?

08:57.120 --> 08:58.689
No, not at all!

09:00.227 --> 09:03.070
I'm glad to see Sakura's feeling better.

09:03.495 --> 09:05.292
And that smile was a first.

09:05.483 --> 09:06.356
Right?

09:06.910 --> 09:10.110
And I'd never seen you so rattled before, either.

09:10.436 --> 09:12.449
You must really hate natto.

09:12.523 --> 09:14.713
Huh? When was I rattled?

09:14.800 --> 09:16.221
I mean, we all saw it.

09:16.603 --> 09:17.618
That aside.

09:20.203 --> 09:22.873
You're the one who's out of sorts now, no?

09:25.366 --> 09:28.935
You've been acting strange since
this morning. What's up?

09:30.960 --> 09:34.603
When we went to visit Sakura,

09:34.966 --> 09:38.264
I said I at least wanted to help him
when he was struggling.

09:38.775 --> 09:42.689
But then I saw him talking to
everyone today, and it hit me.

09:43.058 --> 09:47.581
Oh, this is a guy who can press on
by himself even when he's struggling.

09:48.153 --> 09:50.270
I realized there was nothing…

09:51.741 --> 09:52.898
for me to do.

09:53.876 --> 09:55.218
So at this rate,

09:55.532 --> 09:57.963
there might not be a place for me at his side.

09:58.387 --> 09:59.366
You know that's…

09:59.370 --> 10:00.024
But.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.692
At the same time…

10:06.781 --> 10:09.778
I didn't want that!

10:11.347 --> 10:12.178
I…

10:14.953 --> 10:16.480
I want to stay there.

10:17.692 --> 10:21.735
I want to stay by his side,
and help him reach the top.

10:22.880 --> 10:24.590
The day I met him,

10:24.775 --> 10:26.670
Sakura told me I wasn't lame.

10:27.458 --> 10:29.784
I want to live up to those words!

10:30.387 --> 10:32.787
If he's going to keep pressing forward,

10:33.452 --> 10:35.040
then I have to, as well.

10:36.633 --> 10:37.587
Suo!

10:37.981 --> 10:39.895
I know this is unreasonable to ask,

10:40.541 --> 10:43.624
but please teach me how to fight!

10:44.726 --> 10:46.726
Please… I beg you.

10:51.329 --> 10:54.953
Wow, your self-esteem is a mess.

10:55.544 --> 10:56.873
Huh? What was that?

10:57.261 --> 10:58.910
Before you learn to fight,

10:59.218 --> 11:01.612
you'll have to learn self-defense.

11:05.329 --> 11:06.640
Thank you!

11:06.880 --> 11:08.067
Let's give it our all.

11:08.535 --> 11:12.787
Oh, and you should buy lots of
bandages and compresses.

11:12.910 --> 11:13.538
Eh?

11:15.827 --> 11:18.750
Now, I said I'd start by
teaching you self-defense,

11:19.052 --> 11:23.895
but it's better to take your opponent
out while you defend, no?

11:24.541 --> 11:28.043
Y-You can use defense for offense?!

11:30.707 --> 11:32.209
Become a pillbug!

11:33.532 --> 11:34.276
Huh?

11:34.553 --> 11:35.784
I'll show you.

11:36.141 --> 11:37.169
Put the book down.

11:37.741 --> 11:40.430
Nire, try punching me.

11:40.547 --> 11:42.289
What? B-But that's…

11:42.793 --> 11:43.932
It's okay.

11:45.858 --> 11:47.409
Come on. Just do it.

11:53.784 --> 11:56.929
When people try to punch you,
they always go for the face.

11:57.280 --> 11:59.138
So if you suddenly crouch down…

12:02.012 --> 12:03.821
You vanish from their sight.

12:04.313 --> 12:07.495
They'll look where your face
was, not at their feet,

12:07.926 --> 12:10.098
and won't respond to a sudden obstacle.

12:10.516 --> 12:14.270
As such, their only option
is to fall flat on their face.

12:17.224 --> 12:18.055
You okay?

12:19.969 --> 12:21.236
Huh?

12:23.920 --> 12:26.449
Suo, at least give me a heads-up first!

12:26.780 --> 12:30.793
Sorry about that. I thought you
should experience it yourself first.

12:31.304 --> 12:32.147
But hey…

12:33.046 --> 12:34.356
It's just curling up.

12:34.892 --> 12:36.726
Even I can do that!

12:37.323 --> 12:39.680
Let's see… If you suddenly crouch down,

12:39.858 --> 12:41.649
- you vanish from their sight.
- Mm. That's the spirit.

12:42.590 --> 12:44.898
But there's one condition to using this.

12:45.286 --> 12:46.547
Huh? What is it?

12:51.864 --> 12:54.092
You absolutely can't close your eyes.

12:54.147 --> 12:54.658
Ow!

12:55.347 --> 12:57.452
We'll have to practice that first.

12:58.658 --> 13:00.393
Can I really manage that?

13:03.741 --> 13:06.424
St-St-St-Stand up! On your left!

13:11.723 --> 13:12.492
Sorry.

13:13.126 --> 13:14.960
He's still in training.

13:19.606 --> 13:21.636
I told you not to close your eyes.

13:22.676 --> 13:25.790
But you did very well.

13:30.363 --> 13:31.556
You good for more?

13:31.692 --> 13:32.227
Yes!

13:32.849 --> 13:33.833
I'm fine!

13:42.775 --> 13:43.686
Damn.

13:44.984 --> 13:47.360
What're you smilin' about, punk?!

13:48.793 --> 13:50.689
If you can do that,

13:53.144 --> 13:55.126
you gotta tell me first!

14:04.670 --> 14:06.578
What's with this guy?!

14:27.772 --> 14:29.926
Got you now!

14:36.061 --> 14:36.535
W…

14:36.929 --> 14:38.584
Wow.

14:42.332 --> 14:43.353
U-Um!

14:43.723 --> 14:45.353
A-A-A-Are you okay?

14:45.821 --> 14:46.640
Nire?

14:46.824 --> 14:50.621
S-Sorry. I was just so relieved, I couldn't…

14:50.990 --> 14:54.393
No need to apologize. You did
great for your first time.

14:54.953 --> 14:56.443
Right, Sakura?

14:56.553 --> 14:58.578
Huh? M-Me?

14:59.550 --> 15:02.996
Wait a sec, are you the one who
taught him that risky move?

15:03.126 --> 15:05.236
Yup! The pillbug strategy!

15:05.526 --> 15:06.775
Pillbug?

15:07.907 --> 15:12.738
Oh, but when Suo does it, it's a lot smoother.

15:13.150 --> 15:16.209
I must have looked pretty uncool.

15:20.030 --> 15:21.846
N-Not really.

15:22.818 --> 15:26.424
You weren't… uncool.

15:42.307 --> 15:46.190
O-O-O-On that note, who were these guys?!

15:46.326 --> 15:48.443
I-It looked like they were chasing you.

15:49.230 --> 15:51.950
Ah, yes, um,

15:52.110 --> 15:53.427
the truth is…

16:06.590 --> 16:08.172
Sakura, you okay?

16:08.510 --> 16:09.384
Just fine.

16:10.160 --> 16:12.203
Is he with those guys?

16:14.436 --> 16:15.661
Either way,

16:17.993 --> 16:19.550
he's on another level.

16:21.618 --> 16:23.366
W-Wait a second!

16:25.840 --> 16:27.156
Is it you?!

16:27.372 --> 16:29.852
Are you the ones after Shizuka?!

16:31.310 --> 16:32.713
Wait! They're not!

16:32.830 --> 16:35.420
I told you Shizuka's here for work!

16:35.420 --> 16:36.529
Listen to me!

16:37.033 --> 16:37.581
Wait…

16:37.741 --> 16:40.307
You're all beat up!

16:40.356 --> 16:42.203
P-Please listen to me!

16:42.363 --> 16:44.233
You won't get away with this.

16:44.646 --> 16:47.319
- You damaged Shizuka's beautiful skin…

16:47.319 --> 16:49.353
- You've got it all wrong!
- You damaged Shizuka's beautiful skin…

16:49.378 --> 16:50.572
You're dead mea…

16:55.667 --> 16:58.720
Listen to me!

17:01.618 --> 17:04.350
You have my sincerest apologies!

17:04.769 --> 17:07.649
You saved Shizuka, and I…

17:07.932 --> 17:09.360
I went and…!

17:11.329 --> 17:14.855
In a different age, I'd have had to
slash my guts open in apology!

17:15.015 --> 17:17.587
But… if a finger would satisfy you…

17:17.778 --> 17:20.049
People don't take fingers anymore, either.

17:20.283 --> 17:24.049
I can't believe this. I'm always telling you, Kan!

17:24.332 --> 17:26.030
No jumping to conclusions!

17:26.190 --> 17:27.630
R-Right you are!

17:27.673 --> 17:31.020
[Gripe gripe gripe]
Last time, you jumped out at a firetruck!

17:31.020 --> 17:31.520
[Gripe gripe gripe]
Yeah.

17:31.520 --> 17:34.800
And you almost picked a fight
after that manager apologized!

17:34.941 --> 17:35.969
I'm sorry…

17:35.970 --> 17:37.827
He looks so sad.

17:39.329 --> 17:43.901
No matter how many times you tell me,
my body moves faster than my brain.

17:44.418 --> 17:45.938
I'm really sorry.

17:46.049 --> 17:48.670
It's okay. I'm glad we got it cleared up.

17:49.243 --> 17:50.707
O-On that note,

17:50.996 --> 17:53.316
who exactly are you two?

17:53.452 --> 17:55.403
Ah, sorry!

17:55.753 --> 17:57.649
I'm Nakamura Kanji.

17:57.883 --> 17:58.707
And this

17:58.867 --> 18:00.387
is Narita Shizuka.

18:01.870 --> 18:03.409
Shizuka's a singer,

18:03.530 --> 18:05.846
and I'm a waiter at the club she sings at.

18:05.920 --> 18:07.421
So you're a songstress!

18:07.532 --> 18:09.723
So that's why you're in a dress.

18:10.763 --> 18:13.643
Her voice is pretty as sin!

18:13.778 --> 18:16.516
She's practically an angel on the stage!

18:16.633 --> 18:19.809
What? N-No way! An angel?!

18:20.215 --> 18:24.443
You're always saving me, Kan,
so I'm really grateful, myself!

18:24.535 --> 18:28.380
Y-You dummy, I'm just doing my job!

18:28.380 --> 18:31.384
- You two sure get along well.
- And, I mean, I'm plenty grateful, too…

18:32.320 --> 18:35.464
- This is more than just getting along well.
- I mean, you're my angel!

18:36.061 --> 18:37.975
Why is it always like this lately?

18:38.092 --> 18:38.627
Huh?

18:38.787 --> 18:41.870
Oh, what's wrong? You're beet red.

18:41.926 --> 18:43.292
You're one to talk!

18:43.470 --> 18:44.738
Oh? Am I?

18:56.203 --> 18:57.076
Dammit.

18:57.975 --> 19:00.332
You always were the impatient one.

19:00.916 --> 19:02.461
How many times is this now?

19:03.132 --> 19:05.476
And you let your feelings distract you.

19:06.184 --> 19:09.076
That's why weaklings get the drop on you.

19:09.895 --> 19:12.276
My bad. I really messed up.

19:12.627 --> 19:14.763
Th-There are so many of them!

19:15.046 --> 19:16.270
It's okay.

19:17.076 --> 19:18.572
They're on our side!

19:21.606 --> 19:25.926
Between the ones you got and the
ones we picked up along the way,

19:26.307 --> 19:28.381
I hope this is all of 'em.

19:28.480 --> 19:30.953
Oh, I didn't get 'em.

19:31.255 --> 19:33.532
These guys got 'em for us.

19:33.686 --> 19:34.633
What?

19:35.255 --> 19:37.076
I don't know who you are,

19:37.353 --> 19:40.092
but I apologize for our chairman's mess.

19:40.393 --> 19:41.489
Chairman?

19:43.163 --> 19:47.495
Yeah, we're kinda well-known in these parts.

19:49.113 --> 19:51.889
They call us the Roppo-Ichiza.

19:52.676 --> 19:55.581
And I'm serving as its chairman.

19:56.793 --> 19:58.000
Th-The Ro…

19:58.350 --> 19:59.944
Roppo-Ichiza?!

20:00.172 --> 20:02.233
The hell are you yelling for?

20:02.326 --> 20:03.790
I-I-I mean…!

20:04.000 --> 20:06.196
It's Keisei Street's Roppo-Ichiza!

20:06.350 --> 20:11.261
They're a crazy-violent team that clashed
with Furin all the time back when!

20:11.636 --> 20:12.406
Huh?

20:12.941 --> 20:14.873
Did you just say Furin?

20:15.193 --> 20:15.803
Cr…

20:16.061 --> 20:17.206
Crap!

20:17.347 --> 20:21.396
I haven't heard of them beefing with
Furin lately, so I let my guard down!

20:21.772 --> 20:24.356
Oh no! What do I do? What do I do?!

20:24.713 --> 20:26.012
The hell…

20:26.516 --> 20:28.855
You guys are Furin, are ya?

20:29.009 --> 20:30.683
No wonder you're so strong!

20:30.836 --> 20:31.926
And you!

20:32.166 --> 20:35.126
You defended us even though we only just met!

20:35.329 --> 20:37.913
You're tough, skilled, and kind!

20:38.264 --> 20:40.572
I like you!

20:41.895 --> 20:44.683
I-I wasn't defending you!

20:44.800 --> 20:47.729
But you're not honest! Full of yourself, are ya?

20:48.270 --> 20:50.793
I wanted to punch him and you were in the way!

20:51.033 --> 20:53.267
Um, since you're from Furin,

20:53.421 --> 20:56.055
would you happen to know Tsubaki?

20:56.892 --> 20:59.052
Wait, you know Tsubaki?

20:59.280 --> 21:02.941
We actually came to this part of
town to meet up with him!

21:03.101 --> 21:05.058
Oh, is that why!

21:05.446 --> 21:09.993
I don't just know him! We both
go on stage at the club!

21:10.252 --> 21:11.181
